    "title": "Men's Thermoball™ Jacket",
    "description": "The North Face THERMOBALL™ Jacket is a lightweight, high-performance men's coat designed for versatility on the trail or for everyday wear. It features a slim fit and a ripstop DWR shell that sheds light rain and dries quickly. The jacket is insulated with PrimaLoft® ThermoBall™, a synthetic alternative to down that retains warmth even when wet and offers compressibility equivalent to 600-fill down. Practical features include the ability to stow into its own hand pocket, a stand collar for extra warmth, an exposed VISLON® zipper, a secure interior zip pocket, and an adjustable cinchcord hem. The jacket is constructed from 100% nylon with 100% polyester insulation.",
